■ INTUITUM
PROJECT: DIFFUSE

///

CONTACT: SUPPORT@INTUITUM.SH
LOCATION: USA
STATUS: ONLINE

///

OVERVIEW:
 - Tools to understand and improve software changes across repositories and
   development workflows.
 - Today, a self-hosted GitHub pull-request reviewer that pins the exact head
   and repository context.
 - Runs isolated, read-only Codex and Claude Code investigations.
 - Verifies candidate findings before publishing a review and GitHub Check.

///

PRODUCT DIRECTION:
 - Grow from pull-request review into useful code understanding and review
   wherever developers work.
 - Give individuals and teams flexible review engines, repository context,
   integrations, and automation.
 - Keep security, user control, quality, and practical deployment at the center.

FLOW:
 PULL REQUEST -> CONTEXT -> INVESTIGATION -> VERIFICATION -> REVIEW + CHECK

///

LICENSE:
